                    text: "The sphinx is a 9th-level spellcaster. Its spellcasting ability is Intelligence (spell save DC 16, +8 to hit with spell attacks). It requires no material components to cast its spells. The sphinx has the following wizard spells prepared:\n\n- Cantrips (at will): mage hand, minor illusion, prestidigitation\n- 1st level (4 slots): detect magic, identify, shield\n- 2nd level (3 slots): darkness, locate object, suggestion\n- 3rd level (3 slots): dispel magic, remove curse, tongues\n- 4th level (3 slots): banishment, greater invisibility\n- 5th level (1 slot): legend lore",
